        "id": 3518534,
        "postDate": "2026-08-31T07:41:29.500Z",
        "rawMarkdown": "https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2025.07.23.666425v1  \nASCENT: Annotation-free Self-supervised Contrastive Embeddings for 3D Neuron Tracking in Fluorescence Microscopy  \n\nanother shortcut is :  \nFOCUS3d --> label -->augmentation (e.g. affine, elastic deform) to create window of T=2 pairs.  \nthen you can train link transformer etc..",
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2025.07.23.666425v1\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2025.07.23.666425v1</a><br>\nASCENT: Annotation-free Self-supervised Contrastive Embeddings for 3D Neuron Tracking in Fluorescence Microscopy  </p>\n<p>another shortcut is :<br>\nFOCUS3d --&gt; label --&gt;augmentation (e.g. affine, elastic deform) to create window of T=2 pairs.<br>\nthen you can train link transformer etc..</p>",
        "replies": [
