      {
        "id": 3518488,
        "postDate": "2026-08-31T04:04:38.893Z",
        "rawMarkdown": "FOCUS-3D (instance segmentation) --> HOCT (tracking)    \nhttps://github.com/royerlab/hoct/tree/main  \nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/2607.11754  \nHigher-Order Cell Tracking Transformer  \n\n\n---\n\n\nTHICK BLUE: kaggle annotation  \nOTHER THIN: nearest track from HOCT  \n\n![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F113660%2F335a3eeb48ab9d2b799e6bf2c0ed973a%2FSelection_4733.png?generation=1788148939168370&alt=media)\n\n![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F113660%2F6ae538c0de22bd26ba2f5bc2c8a2f1d7%2FSelection_4734.png?generation=1788148953830155&alt=media)\n\n![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F113660%2F07a0f1d2c25bad1d915b127224cf6e71%2FSelection_4735.png?generation=1788148976594585&alt=media)\n\n![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F113660%2F13a5e112eb312200b3bc018e42c7e078%2FSelection_4736.png?generation=1788149017218352&alt=media)",
        "content": "<p>FOCUS-3D (instance segmentation) --&gt; HOCT (tracking)<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/royerlab/hoct/tree/main\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/royerlab/hoct/tree/main</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.11754\" target=\"_blank\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.11754</a><br>\nHigher-Order Cell Tracking Transformer  </p>\n<hr>\n<p>THICK BLUE: kaggle annotation<br>\nOTHER THIN: nearest track from HOCT  </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F113660%2F335a3eeb48ab9d2b799e6bf2c0ed973a%2FSelection_4733.png?generation=1788148939168370&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F113660%2F6ae538c0de22bd26ba2f5bc2c8a2f1d7%2FSelection_4734.png?generation=1788148953830155&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F113660%2F07a0f1d2c25bad1d915b127224cf6e71%2FSelection_4735.png?generation=1788148976594585&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F113660%2F13a5e112eb312200b3bc018e42c7e078%2FSelection_4736.png?generation=1788149017218352&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>",
