        "rawMarkdown": "This is a draft version, where FOCUS\u20113D is only used as a detector directly\uff1a\nhttps://www.kaggle.com/code/qiweiyin/focus3d-nuclei-physical-pp-submit?scriptVersionId=346624807",
        "content": "<p>This is a draft version, where FOCUS\u20113D is only used as a detector directly\uff1a\n<a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/code/qiweiyin/focus3d-nuclei-physical-pp-submit?scriptVersionId=346624807\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kaggle.com/code/qiweiyin/focus3d-nuclei-physical-pp-submit?scriptVersionId=346624807</a></p>",
        "replies": [
          {
            "id": 3519902,
            "postDate": "2026-09-02T12:49:19.523Z",
            "rawMarkdown": "You should use focus3d, then measure\n1. Hitrate of sparse annotation ( also distance error)\n2. Compare num of detected nodes with estimated number of nodes\n\n```\n    geff_meta = GeffMetadata.read(\n        zarr_file.replace(\".zarr\", \".geff\")\n    )\n\n    est_num_nodes = float(\n        geff_meta.extra[\"estimated_number_of_nodes\"]\n    )\n\n```\n\u2014-\n\nAlso you should evaluate link transformer or other link model given gt location + other location and compared detected location + other location.\n\n",
            "content": "<p>You should use focus3d, then measure</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Hitrate of sparse annotation ( also distance error)</li>\n<li>Compare num of detected nodes with estimated number of nodes</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code>    geff_meta = GeffMetadata.read(\n        zarr_file.replace(\".zarr\", \".geff\")\n    )\n\n    est_num_nodes = float(\n        geff_meta.extra[\"estimated_number_of_nodes\"]\n    )\n</code></pre>\n<p>\u2014-</p>\n<p>Also you should evaluate link transformer or other link model given gt location + other location and compared detected location + other location.</p>",
            "replies": [
              {
                "id": 3519903,
                "postDate": "2026-09-02T12:51:42.613Z",
                "rawMarkdown": "Further, i think gt annotation must have used some open source cell instance detector. I suspect it it cellpose3d or stardist3d with manual collection.",
                "content": "<p>Further, i think gt annotation must have used some open source cell instance detector. I suspect it it cellpose3d or stardist3d with manual collection.</p>",
